hubspot — a HubSpot account's CRM for scripts and agents, read into one local store.

Usage: hubspot <profile> <command> [options]
Account commands start with your profile, a name you choose; none is ever assumed.

What you can do:
  sync                      copy your deals, contacts and companies; the next sync takes the changes
  deals list status:open    open deals with stage, amount and owner, from the store, offline
  search all "kitchen"      stored deals beside your other WireCat tools' data
  people list "Anna"        any contact, read live from the account
  activities list           notes, calls, e-mails, meetings and tasks on your deals
  api deals-list --limit 5  any CRM read of HubSpot's API, one command per operation

Works with:
  tg                        Telegram in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  max                       MAX in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  wa                        WhatsApp in the same local store: search, review and tasks offline
  zm                        Zoom meetings: transcripts and summaries, searchable with your other WireCat data
  drive                     Google Drive and Docs as local text, searchable with your other WireCat data
  gcal                      Google Calendar events, searchable with your other WireCat data
  memo context <person>     one person across messengers, mail, notes and meetings
  mail                      IMAP mail in the same local store: search your mailbox offline, next to your other WireCat data
  b24                       Bitrix24 CRM: deals, leads and pipelines, searchable with your other WireCat data
  pbx                       Asterisk PBX calls and recordings, searchable with your other WireCat data
  notion                    Notion pages and databases as local text, searchable with your other WireCat data

Start here:   hubspot work session start  (any profile name works)
Next:         hubspot commands            every command, by section
              hubspot help options        output, offline, timeouts, dry run
For agents:   hubspot skill show          rules and the discovery loop
